<title>BELGIUM: TRACTEBEL TO ABSORB FIMEUSE .</title>
<headline>TRACTEBEL TO ABSORB FIMEUSE .</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian utility holding company Tractebel SA said on Monday it plans to absorb its Fimeuse unit.</p>
<p>Following a bid for Fimeuse in May, Tractebel now holds more than 96 percent of Fimeuse's capital.</p>
<p>The terms of exchange will be eight Tractebel shares for five Fimeuse shares.</p>
<p>The operation will follow the end of Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA (SGB) 's public offer for Tractebel shares.</p>
<p>Fimeuse is a holding company with a 26.6 percent stake in engineering group Fabricom.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
